# Schema Placement

| Schema type | Correct location | Wrong location |
|------------|-----------------|----------------|
| External API response | UAC external/{source}/schemas.py | Interface adapters, services |
| Canonical normalized type | UAC canonical/domain/{domain}/ | UIC, interfaces, services |
| Internal service message | UIC domain/{service}/ | UAC, interfaces, services |
| Service config | Service's own config.py | UAC, UIC |

